                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64697981-bfa3-4773-9942-c8a7a868667b",
                                                "sense_id": "f8a47cdb-f2b8-3949-86bc-e0d5ba2cdc75",
                                                "text": "Hoya carnosa (Thick-leaved).—Foliage large, flowers in large drooping corymbs; they are of a pinkish-white colour, and contain, or rather yield, drops of pure sweet honey; hence this fine old plant is known as the Honey plant."
                                            }
